@startuml state-offline-change
!include style.iuml
title A change saved on the phone: its states until the server has it (state machine)
hide empty description

state "Pending\n(Saved on device)" as Pending
state "Sending" as Sending
state "Synced" as Synced
state "Conflict\n(Needs attention)" as Conflict
state "Rejected\n(Needs attention)" as Rejected

[*] --> Pending : saved in the encrypted database;\noutbox operation with a new\nidempotency key
Pending --> Sending : sync runs (online, backoff\nover, or "Sync now")
Sending --> Synced : APPLIED\n(removed from the outbox)
Sending --> Pending : network failure, app closed\nduring sync, or the patient in the\nsame batch failed (attempts + 1)
Sending --> Conflict : CONFLICT (a patient edit\nbased on an older version;\nboth copies kept)
Sending --> Rejected : REJECTED\n(reason shown)
Conflict --> Synced : clinician keeps\nthe server's copy
Conflict --> Pending : clinician keeps\ntheir own (re-sent on\nthe newer version)
Rejected --> [*] : clinician discards it
Synced --> Pending : edited again
Synced --> [*]
@enduml
